msgid ""
"For a **MULTIPLEX SRXL** receiver, connect the **SPKT/DSM** port of the "
"Pixhawk to the **B/D** port of the MULTIPLEX SRXL receiver, without using "
"the +3,3V voltage supplied at the **SPKT/DSM** port of the Pixhawk and power"
" the MULTIPLEX SRXL receiver separately. Note that you may also connect to "
"the RCin pin or any appropriately configured serial port, See :ref:`common-"
"flight-controller-wiring`"
msgstr ""
"对于 **MULTIPLEX SRXL** 接收机，请将 Pixhawk 的 **SPKT/DSM** 端口连接至 MULTIPLEX SRXL "
"接收机的 **B/D** 端口，但不要使用 Pixhawk **SPKT/DSM** 端口提供的 +3.3V 电压，需单独为 MULTIPLEX "
"SRXL 接收机供电。注意也可以连接到 RCin 引脚或任何已正确配置的串口，参见 :ref:`common-flight-controller-"
"wiring`"

